                                "sense_id": "b329419f-defd-3512-b0ec-0e8cf28f5a6e",
                                "text": "Something which is corruptible is not yet corrupt. A piece of fruit may be spoilable, but that doesn’t mean that it is spoiled at the present time. In fact, if we said something was spoilable, the normal assumption would be that at the present time it is all right […]"
